<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f3ee">
    <meta name="description" content="A little collection of haiku and everyday observations by Nesru Michael.">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Small Hours — notes by Nesru Michael">
    <meta property="og:description" content="A little collection of haiku and everyday observations by Nesru Michael.">
    <title>Small Hours — notes by Nesru Michael</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/main.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#journal">Skip to the journal</a>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Small Hours home">small<span>hours</span><i aria-hidden="true">.</i></a>
      <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#journal">The journal</a>
        <a href="#about">About Nesru Michael</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="header-note" href="#journal"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> a little light, lately</a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">A PERSONAL JOURNAL · KEPT BY NESRU MICHAEL</p>
        <h1 id="page-title">Small things,<br><em>held a little longer.</em></h1>
        <div class="intro-bottom">
          <p>A growing collection of small poems and ordinary moments worth keeping. Written slowly, somewhere between the rain and the next cup of tea.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="#journal">Wander through the notes <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <span class="intro-mark" aria-hidden="true">M.</span>
      </section>

      <section class="journal" id="journal" aria-labelledby="journal-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">THE NOTEBOOK</p>
            <h2 id="journal-title">A few recent pages</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="entry-count"><%= haikus.length %> little moments</p>
        </div>
        <div class="entry-list">
          <% for (var i = 0; i < haikus.length; i++) { %>
            <article class="entry" id="note-<%= i + 1 %>">
              <div class="entry-index"><span><%= String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0') %></span><span class="entry-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
              <div class="entry-copy">
                <p class="entry-label">A SMALL OBSERVATION</p>
                <p class="haiku"><%= haikus[i].text %></p>
                <a class="entry-link" href="#about" aria-label="Read more about Nesru Michael, the author">A note from Nesru Michael <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              </div>
              <figure class="entry-image">
                <img src="/images/<%= encodeURIComponent(haikus[i].image) %>" alt="An illustrated companion to the poem: <%= haikus[i].text.replace(/\n/g, ' ') %>" loading="lazy">
              </figure>
            </article>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT THIS SPACE</p>
        <div class="about-content">
          <h2 id="about-title">Hello, I’m Nesru Michael.</h2>
          <p>This is where I leave the little things I don’t want to forget: a rainy walk, a song that stayed on repeat, the quiet satisfaction of getting outside. Thanks for being here for a minute.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="mailto:nesrumichael@gmail.com">Email Nesru Michael <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <span class="about-flower" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Small Hours home">small<span>hours</span><i aria-hidden="true">.</i></a>
      <p>Made of moments, and a little bit of ink.</p>
      <a href="#page-title">Back to the top ↑</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
